<style>
  .biz-panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    z-index: 100;
    width: 380px;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    color: #d8dcec;
    background: rgba(11, 14, 26, 0.86);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.18);
    border-radius: 4px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
  }
  .biz-title {
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    font-family: Palatino, "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .biz-subtitle,
  .biz-note {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #8890a8;
  }
  .biz-note {
    margin: 12px 0 0 0;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
  }
  .biz-note strong {
    color: #c8ccdc;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .biz-label,
  .biz-subhead {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 12px 0 5px 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a8a090;
  }
  .biz-subhead {
    margin: 8px 0 3px 0;
    color: #6a7288;
  }
  .biz-label span:last-child {
    color: #e8e4d4;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .biz-btn-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .biz-btn {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #d8dcec;
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.18);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
  }
  .biz-btn-active,
  .biz-btn-active:hover {
    color: #0b0e1a;
    background: #e8b84a;
    border-color: #e8b84a;
  }
  .biz-panel input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: #e8b84a;
  }
  .biz-dial {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8px 1fr 90px 36px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }
  .biz-dial-value {
    text-align: right;
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .biz-swatch {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  #biz-stats {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #9aa2b8;
  }
  .biz-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .biz-stat em {
    color: #6a7288;
  }
  .biz-stat-value {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .biz-net {
    width: 70px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .biz-net.up {
    color: #5ad19a;
  }
  .biz-net.down {
    color: #e86f5a;
  }
  .biz-snap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 3px 0;
  }
  .biz-snap-name {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 2px 5px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #e8e4d4;
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .biz-snap-t {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #6a7288;
  }
  .biz-snap-x {
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: #8890a8;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-section {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
  }
  .biz-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .biz-chip {
    padding: 4px 9px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #d8dcec;
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.18);
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-chip-active {
    color: #0b0e1a;
    background: #e8b84a;
    border-color: #e8b84a;
  }
  .biz-add-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .biz-panel select,
  .biz-panel input[type="number"],
  .biz-panel input:not([type]),
  .biz-panel textarea {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 3px 5px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #e8e4d4;
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.16);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .biz-add-row select {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .biz-ed-head {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .biz-ed-name {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 13px !important;
  }
  .biz-btn-quiet {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  .biz-stocks {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 12px;
  }
  .biz-stock-field {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }
  .biz-stock-field input {
    width: 62px;
  }
  .biz-stock-field span {
    color: #6a7288;
  }
  .biz-flowbox {
    margin: 4px 0 7px 0;
  }
  .biz-flow-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 76px 92px 18px;
    gap: 4px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .biz-flow-row > span.biz-amount-note + input {
    display: none;
  }
  .biz-flow-row:has(input[data-f="scale"]) {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 76px 52px 40px 18px;
  }
  .biz-flow-row:has(input[data-f="scale"]) > span.biz-amount-note + input {
    display: block;
  }
  .biz-amount-note {
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #8890a8;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .biz-feed {
    margin: 3px 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6a7288;
  }
  .biz-feed select {
    max-width: 210px;
  }
  .biz-feed input[type="number"] {
    width: 46px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .biz-feed-bad select {
    border-color: #ff4d4d;
  }
  .biz-add {
    padding: 0 6px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #e8b84a;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 184, 74, 0.4);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-x {
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: #8890a8;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-x:hover {
    color: #ff4d4d;
  }
  .biz-issue {
    margin: 3px 0;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    border-left: 2px solid;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .biz-issue-error {
    color: #ffb4b4;
    background: rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.08);
    border-color: #ff4d4d;
  }
  .biz-issue-warning {
    color: #f0d9a0;
    background: rgba(232, 184, 74, 0.08);
    border-color: #e8b84a;
  }
  .biz-issue-ok {
    color: #a8e8c8;
    background: rgba(90, 209, 154, 0.08);
    border-color: #5ad19a;
  }
  .biz-stat-head {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    color: #c8ccdc;
  }
  .biz-empty {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #8890a8;
  }
  .biz-json summary {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a8a090;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .biz-json textarea {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    height: 140px;
    margin: 6px 0;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .biz-json-ok {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #5ad19a;
  }
  .biz-json-bad {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #ff4d4d;
  }
</style>

<div
  id="biz-container"
  data-start-layout="parts"
  data-start-view="single"
  style="width: 100%; height: 100vh; background: #0b0e1a;">
</div>

<div
  class="biz-panel">
  <h3
    class="biz-title">
    Business Model
  </h3>
  <p
    class="biz-subtitle">
    Each model is what comes in, what goes out, and how much.
    Link one model's output to another's input to combine them; only valid links are offered.
    The combination is itself a model, so you can view it as its parts or as one whole.
  </p>

  <div
    class="biz-label">
    <span>
      Models
    </span>
  </div>
  <div
    id="biz-models"
    class="biz-chips">
  </div>
  <div
    class="biz-add-row">
    <select
      id="biz-template"
      aria-label="Template">
    </select>
    <button
      id="biz-add"
      class="biz-btn">
      Add model
    </button>
  </div>

  <div
    id="biz-editor"
    class="biz-section">
  </div>

  <div
    class="biz-section">
    <div
      class="biz-label">
      <span>
        View
      </span>
    </div>
    <div
      id="biz-layouts"
      class="biz-btn-group">
      <button
        class="biz-btn"
        data-layout="parts">
        Parts
      </button>
      <button
        class="biz-btn"
        data-layout="whole">
        Whole
      </button>
    </div>
    <div
      id="biz-views"
      class="biz-btn-group"
      style="margin-top: 4px;">
      <button
        class="biz-btn"
        data-view="single">
        One moment
      </button>
      <button
        class="biz-btn"
        data-view="snapshots">
        Snapshots side by side
      </button>
    </div>

    <label
      class="biz-label"
      for="biz-time">
      <span>
        Time
      </span>
      <span
        id="biz-time-value">
      </span>
    </label>
    <input
      type="range"
      id="biz-time"
      min="0"
      max="24"
      step="0.1"
      value="0" />
    <div
      class="biz-btn-group">
      <button
        id="biz-play"
        class="biz-btn">
        Play months
      </button>
      <button
        id="biz-pin"
        class="biz-btn">
        Pin this month
      </button>
    </div>
    <div
      class="biz-label">
      <span>
        Snapshots
      </span>
    </div>
    <div
      id="biz-snapshots">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="biz-section">
    <div
      class="biz-label">
      <span>
        Checks
      </span>
    </div>
    <div
      id="biz-issues">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    id="biz-stats">
  </div>

  <details
    id="biz-json-panel"
    class="biz-json biz-section">
    <summary>
      Workspace JSON
    </summary>
    <textarea
      id="biz-json"
      spellcheck="false"
      aria-label="Workspace JSON">
    </textarea>
    <div
      class="biz-btn-group">
      <button
        id="biz-copy"
        class="biz-btn">
        Copy
      </button>
      <button
        id="biz-load"
        class="biz-btn">
        Load
      </button>
      <button
        id="biz-reset"
        class="biz-btn">
        Reset to example
      </button>
    </div>
    <p
      id="biz-json-status">
    </p>
  </details>

  <p
    class="biz-note">
    <strong>Reading it.</strong>
    Column height is a stock, scaled to its peak over the run; the ring marks that peak.
    Particle speed and density are a flow's rate.
    Arcs between models are links, labelled with the share they carry.
    Red means an output wanted more than its stock held.
    Interest is latent, so it is drawn as a ghost; a diamond port (◇) is not conserved.
    Your workspace is saved in this browser.
  </p>
  <p
    class="biz-note">
    Drag to orbit, scroll to zoom, click a model to edit it, hover for values.
  </p>
</div>

<script>
  window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    window.business = window.businessModel();
  });
</script>
